      "endo_proof": "f_pi=62. Full rational 2-torsion proves (pi-1)/2 is an endomorphism, excluding factor2 from f_E. For ell=31, trace/2=-1 mod31 and x^p=x modulo the degree480 division polynomial psi_31, so Frobenius acts as [-1] on E[31]. Thus (pi+1)/31 is an endomorphism, excluding factor31. Consequently f_E=1."
